            <ArticleTitle>[The impact of clopidogrel and aspigrel on fatty acid spectrum of platelet membrane phospholipids in patients with new-onset angina].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>21-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The research of more effective unstable angina treatment is still actual despite the definite protocols exist. It was investigated the lipid acids spectrum of platelet membrane phospholipids in patients with new-onset angina and was analyzed the impact of clopidogrel and aspigrel on its changes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
